    "limitations": "Bounded content-type loop repair only: authoritative held tags.contentType drives future learning, absent own tag uses safe type on live decision input without rewriting catalog/render metadata. Whole canonical lists1..8 distinct trimmed1..64 code-unit strings, no controls/angle brackets/reserved prototype names; malformed explicit tags retain historical scoring but produce no new canonical touches. Catalog-dimension tags are arrays independent of raw event source/multi mapping; non-derived registered contentType key required for held touches. Idless or successful catalog miss retains existing sanitized event fallback, not authenticated exposure/asset provenance. When contentType is not configured, legacy event extraction runs without lookup or added content-ID validation; invalid-ID refusal applies with that dimension configured. Catalog read failure refuses before new affinity/population effects; existing30s publication cache/staleness and cold-read cost remain. No historical profile migration or event backfill; retained replay runs its original tag-only scoring by absent marker. Full W19/F27/N15 registry/locale/slot/unusable-taxonomy/inheritance/customer feed acceptance remains open; native whole-path latency, W35 authority, gates and release separate. No SDK/build/install/new infrastructure/broad suite/cloud/deploy/provision/seed/credentials/customer-data/destructive/commit/push/external or customer-policy action.",
